diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index c7a9712..2d3ff47 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -41,6 +41,13 @@ Add following environment variables to Heroku:
 - `NODE_ENV=production`
 - `SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN`
 
+### Continuous integration
+
+The smoke test workflow runs the server and client checks as two parallel jobs
+to shorten the feedback loop. The application container exposes a healthcheck on
+`/api/healthz` so orchestrators can wait for it to become ready before routing
+traffic to it.
+
 ## About project
 
 Work hours can be found [here](work-hours.md). They explain pretty well the flow of this project, and what has been done. Here is table of things that I want mention in somewhat categories.
